Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.48,0:00:07.02,Title,,0,0,150,,{\fad(600,900)\pos(960,815)\fs90\bord3\blur2}-1868 England-
Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.48,0:00:07.02,Title,,0,0,150,,{\fad(600,900)\pos(960,815)\fs90}-1868 England-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.82,0:00:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feast your eyes on that rat, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dumb nation! Woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.02,0:00:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This bastard must have\Ndied right quick, like.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.72,0:00:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fell off that cliff, I'll warrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Courage wheels slipped in the mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.56,0:00:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They weren't hurting for coin, if\Nthese fine clothes tell it true.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.62,0:00:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dario, the lady is dead,\Nbut the baby with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.52,0:00:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still alive. I can hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.54,0:00:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She must have protected it\Nwith her body. Leave it be.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.40,0:00:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon enough it'll be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.74,0:00:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.66,0:00:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got eyes, ain't you, woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.20,0:00:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm appropriating his jewellery, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.54,0:00:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.58,0:00:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Evil-looking thing, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.50,0:00:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, fetch me nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.76,0:00:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.88,0:00:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lend a hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.94,0:00:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me yank out his pearly teeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.34,0:01:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll fetch a pretty copper!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.82,0:01:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Providence sends me aid in the\Nguise of a man. Many thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.02,0:01:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.06,0:01:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My wife and son.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.64,0:01:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, do they live?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.80,0:01:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but your wife, Saint's\NPreserver, has gone on to a heavenly rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.70,0:01:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the baby is alive and well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.26,0:01:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fate is...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.52,0:01:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,most cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.98,0:01:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is George Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.46,0:01:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have saved my life this cursed night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.78,0:01:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quickly tell me your name that I may\Nremember before my senses fail me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.60,0:01:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This peacock thinks I'm here\Nout of the goodness of me heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.10,0:01:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little does he know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.62,0:01:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll oblige him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.16,0:01:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dario Brando, your lordship.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.38,0:02:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, I swear to you, the Joestar family\Nwill honor the debt we have incurred.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.69,0:02:15.65,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,820)\bord3\blur2}-12 Years Later-
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.69,0:02:15.65,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,820)}-12 Years Later-
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.02,0:02:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, there's a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.06,0:02:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father, I'm off!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.96,0:02:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then fare thee well,\NJojo. Let's go, Danny.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.10,0:02:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T. O.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.10,0:02:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mind your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.70,0:02:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn your eyes, you\Nlazy boy. Are you deaf?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.48,0:02:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want, father? Medicine?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.90,0:02:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.08,0:02:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their snake oil does me no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.18,0:02:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.09,0:02:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't come back until\Nyou've found me some booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.54,0:03:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your manners are dreadful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.58,0:03:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.74,0:03:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Checkmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.18,0:03:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.40,0:03:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't feel so smart now, do you, Welp?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.50,0:03:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, let me guess, Serena, your daddy\Nbought you this doll, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.10,0:03:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.06,0:03:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being a quack must pay him real nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.32,0:03:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.23,0:03:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say we peel off\Nthis fancy-looking dress, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.12,0:03:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And see if they made her with all\Nthe real girl bits underneath.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.28,0:03:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.08,0:03:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.84,0:03:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arena's a crybaby!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.92,0:03:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arena's a crybaby!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.98,0:03:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arena's a crybaby!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.89,0:03:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.81,0:03:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it back to her right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.40,0:03:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.58,0:03:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You some friend of Arena's?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.34,0:03:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never met her, but I'll\Nfight for her all the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.68,0:04:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this idiot getting in a\Nfight for a girl he don't even know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.14,0:04:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like somebody It\Nwas nothing but chalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.88,0:04:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at him there on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.76,0:04:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.96,0:04:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some knight in shining\Narmor you turned out to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.60,0:04:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.51,0:04:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This little panty waist\Nis the Joestar kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I know you're some rich\Nguy's son, we're just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.74,0:04:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't buy your way out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.52,0:04:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get him some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.70,0:04:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.00,0:04:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not long for this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.20,0:04:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I die, you get yourself to the\NJoestar mansion along with this letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fool thinks he owes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.12,0:04:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your ticket to greatness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.88,0:04:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your only chance, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.14,0:04:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go out there and take this\Nuseless world for all you can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.00,0:05:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crawl on back to your damn manor,\Nlittle Lord Fauntleroy. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.76,0:05:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.94,0:05:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.40,0:05:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.84,0:05:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did not take a beating\Njust now for your sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.14,0:05:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So whatever you're thinking, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.10,0:05:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I want is to conduct\Nmyself as a gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.24,0:05:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I spotted a damsel in distress.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.74,0:05:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A true gentleman has no fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.88,0:05:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll fight for those who can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.66,0:05:33.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even knowing it's a fight he has no\Nchance of winning, he enters the fray.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.96,0:05:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday, I'll have the strength to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.76,0:05:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Devil that you were, you drove\Nmother to an early grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.96,0:05:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May you burn for your sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.46,0:05:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The riches that eluded your grasp,\NI will claim them in excess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.98,0:05:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You lacked the cunning to take\Nwhat you wanted, but I'll prevail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.86,0:05:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This Joestar shall be the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.44,0:06:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.10,0:06:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will claim what is rightfully mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.66,0:06:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jonathan Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.20,0:06:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the tale of two young men,\Ntheir destinies bound to intersect,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.04,0:06:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the stone mask that\Nchanges their fates forever.
