Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.50,0:07:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.96,0:07:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be Dio Brando, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.68,0:07:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're Jonathan, heir\Nto the Joestars. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.48,0:07:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, call me Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.94,0:07:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.02,0:07:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Danny!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.42,0:07:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Danny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.54,0:07:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my dog as well as\Nmy steadfast companion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.60,0:07:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.51,0:07:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knows better than to nip at strangers.
