Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.24,0:07:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.78,0:07:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is the brat I must usurp.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.66,0:07:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's his heart on his sleeve?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.32,0:07:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's quick to anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.30,0:07:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This pampered fool is no match\Nfor the likes of Dio Brando.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.98,0:07:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.88,0:07:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would know what this is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.76,0:07:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.67,0:07:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dog jumped at me, and\Nin my haste, I struck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.50,0:07:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the manor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.78,0:07:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider yourself a part\Nof the family. Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.08,0:08:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have died in the crash that claimed\Nmy wife were it not for Dio's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.84,0:08:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will treat him as\Nyou would my own son.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.44,0:08:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well, your lordship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your home now, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.52,0:08:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please avail yourself of all its comforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.22,0:08:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir, for taking\Nin this poor unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.20,0:08:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo has lost his mother as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.64,0:08:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're the same age.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.42,0:08:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be thick as thieves soon, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.26,0:08:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio didn't mean to hurt Danny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.72,0:08:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.63,0:08:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It stands to reason, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.70,0:08:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If a strange dog jumped at\Nme, I'd be surprised too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.82,0:08:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish his apology had been more sincere,\Nbut as we'll be living here together,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.10,0:08:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do my utmost to be friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.88,0:08:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.22,0:08:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show you your chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.14,0:08:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're hurting me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.42,0:08:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.38,0:08:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.58,0:09:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's allowed to touch my\Nthings without my permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.48,0:09:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.39,0:09:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time you reach for what's\Nmine with this paw, I'll break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.32,0:09:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was only trying to help.
