Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.72,0:09:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will have a servant\Ncarry them up for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, I may be a guest within your\Nhouse, but I am not to be trifled with.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In all things that I do, I am number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.14,0:09:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look down your nose at\Nme and you'll regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.80,0:09:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Dio, I want for us to be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.32,0:09:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And another thing, I hate all mongrels.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.68,0:09:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.12,0:09:33.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just despise how they\Nfawn over the unworthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.36,0:09:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So keep that mangy mutt of yours\Nwell away from me, Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.16,0:09:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio, what's keeping you? Hurry along.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.84,0:09:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.86,0:09:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With Dio's sudden arrival, Jojo's\Ncarefree life spiraled into one of misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.78,0:09:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got another one wrong, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.28,0:09:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.30,0:09:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,20 out of 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.38,0:09:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a single mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.82,0:10:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, your table manners\Nare simply abhorrent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.98,0:10:07.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You act as if you were raised in a bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.96,0:10:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clear Jojo's plate at once.\NHe's had enough. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.16,0:10:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all the dinner you get tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.14,0:10:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's clear to me that I failed in\Nyour upbringing when I look at Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.90,0:10:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If your mother could see you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.38,0:10:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio's manners are impeccable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.66,0:10:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an oaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.80,0:10:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our first Fugilist up is Jonathan Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.68,0:10:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been looking\Nstronger lately, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.68,0:10:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for his opponent today, it's\Na boxer we haven't seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.68,0:10:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a newcomer to our fair city.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.58,0:10:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we know is his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.50,0:10:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.72,0:10:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Introducing our surprise\Nopponent, Dio Brando.
