Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.18,0:11:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at him, dojo! Tits!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.46,0:11:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen the like!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.96,0:11:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't connect!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.54,0:11:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pampered brat can box,\NI'll grant him that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.06,0:11:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.80,0:11:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's never had to punch his way\Nout of a scrape in the slums,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.12,0:11:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and thus I hold the advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.58,0:11:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.28,0:11:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.36,0:11:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo loses the fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.38,0:11:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your suffering isn't over yet, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.48,0:11:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll jam a thumb into\Nyour eye for good measure,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.38,0:11:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lest you forget who you're dealing with!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.80,0:11:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That arm of his is unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.44,0:11:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio, that punch was simply amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.66,0:11:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you dodge him so well?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.04,0:11:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a little defensive\Nfootwork I acquired along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.60,0:12:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you'd like to learn it, I'd be more\Nthan happy to teach it to you fellas!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.04,0:12:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You would do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.12,0:12:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do take care that nobody shows it to Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.86,0:12:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't keep a secret to save his life!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.22,0:12:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.60,0:12:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.58,0:12:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thumb in my eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.86,0:12:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.96,0:12:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loneliness will devour a man from within.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.84,0:12:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll reduce Jojo to an empty husk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.14,0:12:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bit by bit, I'll steal the\Nlife he was meant to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.32,0:12:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the time we're grown,\Nthere'll be nothing left of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.46,0:12:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn that Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.46,0:12:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.12,0:12:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's ruining everything he touches.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.50,0:12:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look alive, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's me, Jonathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.56,0:12:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.80,0:12:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mind if I join you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.64,0:12:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.02,0:12:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn I heard\Na voice a moment ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.00,0:12:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a snitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.16,0:12:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better to ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.54,0:12:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.98,0:13:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a snitch, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.46,0:13:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call me that to my face. Time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.16,0:13:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just nothing but a snitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.72,0:13:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you always write about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.98,0:13:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just a stupid rich boy, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.18,0:13:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me what I snitched about then!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.10,0:13:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's lying to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.54,0:13:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you just take him at his word?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.80,0:13:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo the Squealer!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.90,0:13:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.81,0:13:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's slandering me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.06,0:13:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He lies and lies and\Npeople just eat it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.14,0:13:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the first day he showed up,\Nhe's been trying to destroy me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.00,0:13:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Dio Brando!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.80,0:13:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio! Dio! Dio! Dio! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.82,0:13:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since he arrived,\Neveryone's turned on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.30,0:13:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even father.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.52,0:13:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Danny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.88,0:13:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you will always be my\Nfriend, no matter what Dio does.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:13:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.28,0:14:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who was that girl just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.40,0:14:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel as though I have\Nseen her face before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.94,0:14:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my handkerchief.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.74,0:14:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She brought grapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.62,0:14:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, thank you for the fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.84,0:14:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I'll be here tomorrow\Nif you want to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.06,0:14:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't even tell me her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.94,0:14:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.48,0:14:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Girls are such a curious bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.26,0:14:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dark time in Jonathan's life was suddenly\Nmade brighter by love's growing embers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.02,0:14:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two became fast friends, and\NJonathan was enchanted by her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.98,0:14:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iran Pendleton, the name\Nis music to my ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.42,0:14:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.80,0:14:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What on earth are you\Ndoing to that poor tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.86,0:14:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, what possessed you\Nto do that? Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.28,0:14:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Iran. Till next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.70,0:15:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your name wouldn't happen\Nto be Iran, would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.86,0:15:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and Jojo, you make such\Na smart-looking couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.34,0:15:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, I should have guessed as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.76,0:15:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try as I might to ruin his life,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.94,0:15:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,young Master Jonathan has\Nbeen oddly happy as of late.
