Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.04,0:15:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.95,0:15:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.76,0:15:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give her the what for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.44,0:15:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The trouble I'd get into\Nif I was brave as Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.46,0:15:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just does what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.92,0:15:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Devil may care.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.42,0:15:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, have you and Jojo kissed yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.48,0:15:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take that as a no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.68,0:15:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You thought your first kiss\Nwould be Jojo, but it was I, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.56,0:16:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it was by force, the\Nfact that I kissed her is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.22,0:16:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've killed their romance before it began!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.92,0:16:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll deny Jojo the comfort\Nof friendship and love.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.94,0:16:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.42,0:16:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at her, Dio She's\Ntaking leave of her senses
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.24,0:16:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.58,0:16:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's disgusting Washing\Nout her mouth with
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.02,0:16:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a muddy puddle Why would anybody do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.36,0:16:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a stream not far away
