Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool your temper, you damnable fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.66,0:16:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not worth losing your head over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.50,0:16:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're done here. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.56,0:16:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arena! Hey there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.94,0:16:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arena, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.94,0:16:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd she run off?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.34,0:17:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it something I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.30,0:17:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at him, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.54,0:17:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't know why she ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.40,0:17:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say we tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.78,0:17:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He deserves to know what his\Nprecious arena's been up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.88,0:17:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.79,0:17:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd feel bad making his\Nlittle lordship start to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.20,0:17:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is his doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.32,0:17:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you done, Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.18,0:17:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you done to my arena?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.84,0:17:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,RAAAGH!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.08,0:17:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DIO!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.14,0:17:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hush, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.36,0:17:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't speak my name in vain again\Nif you know what's good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.32,0:17:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We end this now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.92,0:17:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you sully an\Ninnocent maiden's honor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.00,0:17:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your fight is with me, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.36,0:17:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Upset about Iran?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.90,0:17:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That she shared her favors with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.00,0:17:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now you intend to give me a\Nproper thrashing for my impudence?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.66,0:17:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time, Dio, you have gone too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.22,0:17:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may be right, but\Nyou're the one who'll pay...
