Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.06,0:18:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looking to repeat your\Nperformance from our boxing match?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.09,0:17:59.14,SFXRed,8,0,0,0,,{=46}{\blur0.8\bord11.36\fscx147.62\fscy113.56\frz10.94\pos(547.13,565.38)\c&H000C1D&}Agh!
Dialogue: 2,0:17:59.09,0:17:59.14,SFXRed,8,0,0,0,,{=46}{\blur0.8\bord0\fscx147.62\fscy113.56\frz10.94\pos(547.13,565.38)\4a&HFF&}Agh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.32,0:18:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.86,0:18:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.92,0:18:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I lose here now, I'll spend the\Nrest of my life cowering in Dio's shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.40,0:18:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most of all, I have to\Nfight for Irina's honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.64,0:18:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She needs a champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.92,0:18:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to end this little pissing match.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.68,0:18:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll beat him here, in his own home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.50,0:18:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once and for all, he'll know his proper\Nplace in this world is under my heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.04,0:18:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll see that it's useless\Nto try and defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.80,0:18:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall be master, now and always.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.96,0:18:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.08,0:18:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.99,0:18:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right in the face!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.66,0:18:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you able to grab me\Nafter such a blow to the head?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.62,0:18:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I was too gentle with you!
