Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.64,0:19:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You how? How dare you!\NHow dare you strike me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.54,0:19:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Days crying. I'll make you\Nregret that you filthy car stop
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.92,0:19:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it both of you that is\Nquite enough father i son i
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.80,0:19:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know that boys your age are\Nprone to fisticuffs however
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.58,0:19:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,jojo i saw you pummeled\NDio mercilessly after the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.80,0:19:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,point at which he had obviously\Nno chance of winning the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.20,0:19:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fight such is the mark of\Na coward no excuses to your
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.62,0:20:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,chambers both of you i'll\Ndecide your punishment anon
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.76,0:20:11.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that seems strange wonder what's in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.10,0:20:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.06,0:20:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably some are made for out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.96,0:20:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.87,0:20:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something got into the incinerator!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.84,0:20:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.88,0:20:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if a person's in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.96,0:20:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're burning alive, and it's\Nall my fault for lighting it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.22,0:20:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iran?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.18,0:20:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.84,0:20:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beat you fair and square!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.82,0:20:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what does it matter if you've\Nruined things for Iran and me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.08,0:20:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We buried him while you were gone, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.40,0:20:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was nothing you should have to witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.42,0:21:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The constable said it\Nwas probably the work of
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.94,0:21:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a burglar who caught sight\Nof Dany and panicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.92,0:21:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio, he's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.74,0:21:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He hasn't yet returned\Nfrom school today, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.56,0:21:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo fled to his room and\Nfell into a dreamless slumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.66,0:21:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he awoke, he thought of Danny,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.42,0:21:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his loyal pet and one true\Nfriend, now lost to him, and wept.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.68,0:21:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.59,0:21:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may have evened the\Nscore by killing his mutt,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.08,0:21:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it doesn't change the fact that\NJojo is far stronger than I'd thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.36,0:21:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bloody his nose, and he\Ncomes back twice as fierce.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.74,0:21:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My anger makes me vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.58,0:21:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must remedy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.42,0:21:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I learn to master my temper, I'll\Nbe invincible to the likes of Jojo.
