Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.12,0:22:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.38,0:22:07.97,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.16,0:22:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The words will make you out and out.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.97,0:22:11.43,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,The words will make you out 'n' out
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.34,0:22:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And spend the day your way.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.43,0:22:16.77,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.60,0:22:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call it morning, driving through the sun.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.77,0:22:19.44,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sound and
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.42,0:22:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in and out the valley.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.44,0:22:23.98,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,In and out the valley
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.36,0:22:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The music, dance and sing.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.49,0:22:35.08,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,The music dance and sing
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.18,0:22:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They make the children really ring.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.08,0:22:38.54,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They make the children really ring
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.40,0:22:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.54,0:22:43.88,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.70,0:22:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call it morning, driving through the sun.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.88,0:22:46.55,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sound and
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.55,0:22:50.51,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,In and out the valley
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.56,0:22:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in and out the valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.28,0:22:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In and out around the lake.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.51,0:22:52.93,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,In and around the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.00,0:22:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miles come out of the sky.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.18,0:22:56.39,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Mountains come out of the sky
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.39,0:22:58.18,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,and they stand there
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.42,0:22:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they'll stand there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.28,0:23:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One mile over, we'll be\Nthere and we'll see you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.35,0:23:05.07,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,One mile over we'll be there and we'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.68,0:23:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten and two summers, we'll\Nbe there and laughing too.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.74,0:23:11.53,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Ten true summers we'll be there and laughing too
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.20,0:23:17.95,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Twenty four before my love you'll see I'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.24,0:23:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twenty-four and five\Nmiles over, we'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.14,0:23:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be there with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.95,0:23:20.96,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,There with you
