Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.46,0:23:29.47,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\pos(960,700)}Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.68,0:23:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seven years later...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.04,0:23:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bowl is plucked out\Nof the air by our hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.52,0:23:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having read it, all has been made clear.
